{{define "main"}}
    <div class="register-head">
        <h1>No accounts yet</h1>
    </div>
    <p>This database has no accounts, so there is no register to show.</p>
    <p class="muted">
        Creating accounts and entering transactions from the browser is not built yet.
        To see what a register looks like, stop the program and start it again with
        <code>go run ./cmd/checkbook -demo</code>, which serves a small sample
        household from memory and writes nothing to disk.
    </p>
{{end}}
